ron","Mick Regan","W.K. Stratton","James DiStefano","Hal Rayle","Vachik Mangassarian","Tim Donnelly","Carole Francis","Sheila Wills","Jon Paré","Justin Gocke","Garnett Smith","Bradley Fisher","Pat Sajak","Lydia Cornell","Denise Gallup","Dian Gallup","Joseph Hacker","Damon Clark","Jennifer Roach","Jason Edwards","Toni Sawyer","Eileen Barnett","Harry Woolf","John Perak","Ken Norton","Kevin McBride","Terrence O'Connor","Gillian Grant","Jeannie Wilson","Robb Madrid","Stephen Liska","Rick Grassi","Michelle Rosas","Kristen Meadows","Melanie Wilson","Mary Kate McGeehan","Julie Rhodes","Lisa Antille","Nedra Volz","Carol Baxter","Howard Vann","Leslie Kawai","Dawn Mangrum","Ismael 'East' Carlo","Tom Noga","Jim Knaub","Jon L. Feather","Charles Hyman","Pearl Huang","Jimmy Lennon Sr.","Adele K. West","Kelbe Nugent","Larry Marko","Solomon Trager","Guy Christopher","Eric Server","Dean Wein","Frank Annese","Richard Kuhlman","Lew Saunders","Ricky Steamboat","Bob Destri Hilgenberg","Adam Ageli","Eric Goldner","Edy Roberts","Shawn Ora Engemann","Nick Cavanaugh","Christopher Thomas","Anthony S. Johnson","Nick Hardin","Ben Jurand","David Clover"],"screenwriters":["Paul Bernbaum","Frank Lupo","Richard Christian Matheson","Tom Szollosi","Stephen J. Cannell","Bruce Cervi","Steve Beers","Patrick Hasburgh","Terry D. Nelson","Allan Cole","Bill Nuss","Stephen Katz","Tom Blomquist","Burt Pearl","Jeff Ray","Steven L. Sears","Jo Swerling Jr.","Chris Bunch","Babs Greyhosky","Sidney Ellis","Milt Rosen"],"cinematographers":["Frank E. Johnson","Bradley B. Six"],"composers":["Garry Schyman","Mike Post","Pete Carpenter"],"reviews":[{"author":"Nekrofil","text":"Kto tvrdí, že A-Team majú radi iba tí, ktorí na ňom vyrastali, a ktorí ho sledovali ešte v dobe, keď ho vysielali prvýkrát, tak to je úplný (ako by povedali Francúzi) BULLSHIT!!! S A-Teamom som sa zoznámil cca. v roku 2008, keď som náhodou zachytil jednu z prvých epizód v telke. Nemusím snáď dodávať, že odvtedy som každú ďalšiu časť hltal ako blázon! Zamiloval som si každého jedného svojrázneho člena tohto najlepšieho tímu na svete a spolu s nimi aj ich dokonalé plány a smrtonostné vynálezy (ktoré samozrejme nikdy nikoho nezabili, A-Team sú predsa dobráci;-). Samozrejme by niektorí mohli namietať, že A-Team je úplne nelogický a nerealistický. Odpoveďou na toto tvrdenie budiž môj predošlý výrok - BULLSHIT!!! Čo ma tam po logike a realizme, keď sa nepretržite smejem a zabávam? Nie je presne to podstatou komediálno-akčných seriálov? Pre mňa osobne je A-Team čistou vydestilovanou geniaitou, presne takto si predstavujem výbornú televíznu zábavu. Definitívne jeden z mojich najobľúbenejších seriálov. Dať menej ako 100% by bola čistá blasfémia!(10.10.2010)","stars":5},{"author":"Dever","text":"Soundtrack Mike Post:1. Theme from The A-Team\n,2. Young Hannibal\n,3. B.A.'s Ride\n,4. The A-Team in New York City\n,5. Bandits!\n,6. Taxi Chase\n,7. The A-Team Escape\n,8. The A-Team Prepare for War\n,9. Showtime\n,10.\tMove, Sucker\n,11.\tLet's Get Busted\n,12.\tMurdock's Face\n,13.\tHelicopters\n,14.\tMore Bandits\n,15.\tTheme from The A-Team ,(09.05.2011)","stars":1},{"author":"MM_Ramone","text":"Nikdy som nemal rád toto podivné, akčné, mužské kvarteto. Štvorica veteránov vietnamskej vojny, ktorí boli po návrate do vlasti, neprávom obvinnení zo zločinu, čo nespáchali. Sú na úteku pred zákonom a popri tom sa nechávajú naverbovať na to, aby zjednali poriadok a spravodlivosť,  tam kde si to situácia vyžaduje. Nepáči sa mi námet, ani technické spracovanie. Charaktery postáv sú mi vyložene protivné, a herci nesympatickí. Šedivec, buzna, blázon a opica - to má byť \"A-Team\". *(23.03.2011)","stars":1}],"vods":[{"platform":"Prime Video","url":"https://www.primevideo.com/detail/amzn1.dv.gti.84a9f669-b8ec-98ce-7d2c-54f9c1b25c4c"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/axn:20260803e504990311b5057b78bef5848724c080"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/a-tym-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/69303-a-team/prehled/","csfd_id":69303,"root_id":69303,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":5,"episode_count":97,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[]}